meta {
  name: Forgot Password (Request OTP via Email)
  type: http
  seq: 5
}

post {
  url: {{base_url}}/api/v1/password/forgot
  body: json
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
}

body:json {
  {
    "email": "user@amanah.test"
  }
}

docs {
  # Forgot Password (Request OTP via Email)
  Permintaan reset password dengan mengirimkan OTP ke alamat email pengguna.
  
  ### Expected Response (200 OK):
  ```json
  {
    "status": "success",
    "message": "Kode OTP reset password telah dikirimkan ke email Anda.",
    "data": {
      "email": "user@amanah.test",
      "expires_in": 300
    }
  }
  ```
  
  ### Error Response (404 Not Found):
  ```json
  {
    "status": "error",
    "message": "Email tidak ditemukan di sistem kami."
  }
  ```
}
